    thinking: "**Analyzing App Name**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on keeping the application name as JARVIS, while simultaneously evaluating and understanding the available skills. My immediate concern is aligning the app\'s name with its functionality, and I\'m currently cross-referencing this against available skills like `applet-seo`, `cloudsql-execute-sql`, and others to ensure a relevant fit.\n\n\n**Evaluating JARVIS Skills**\n\nI\'m now carefully examining the skill set I need to build into JARVIS. The current app\'s metadata is empty, and the UI is just a blank div, so I have a lot of work to do. My aim is to make JARVIS an advanced AI assistant, inspired by Iron Man\'s JARVIS, complete with voice recognition, task execution, and a sleek interface. I\'m focusing on integrating technologies like Gemini API, and considering modules such as Mission Control and Code execution.\n\n\n"
