    skill_metadata {
      name: "gemini-api"
      description: "Provides model selection guidance and coding patterns for the @google/genai TypeScript SDK. Use when the application requires AI capabilities (e.g., text/image generation, smart features) or when the task involves implementing an \"AI-powered\" feature. The model should prefer this modern SDK over legacy alternatives. Do NOT use for general discussions about AI without implementation intent. Covers model aliases, streaming, chat, function calling, search and maps grounding, Live API, TTS, and API key handling."
    }
