  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing CSS for Project**\n\nI\'m currently focused on developing `src/index.css` with Tailwind v4, anticipating custom HUD styling. I\'ve confirmed that `@import \"tailwindcss\";` works as expected. Now, I\'m defining custom theme rules and utility classes to personalize the look. I have started by defining a root variable for --hud-cyan.\n\n\n**Defining Styles, Fonts & Glows**\n\nI\'ve defined a suite of custom variables for HUD colors including cyan, blue, amber, and crimson, along with dimmed variants, in the root scope. I\'ve integrated fonts like Orbitron, Rajdhani, and JetBrains Mono for a distinct feel. I\'m focusing on sci-fi HUD glow effects with box-shadows and text-shadows, creating glow-cyan, amber, and crimson variations with different intensities.\n\n\n**Implementing Visual Effects**\n\nI\'ve crafted `glow-text` utility classes for amber and crimson text effects. I\'m focusing on a scanline effect using a linear gradient, and I\'m developing a tech grid background. I\'ve also defined spin and pulse animation keyframes for dynamic elements. Now, I\'m working to integrate these into the larger design, and I\'m testing the animations and effects.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1734866"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  :root {\\n    --hud-cyan: #00f0ff;\\n    --hud-cyan-dim: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);\\n    --hud-blue: #0284c7;\\n    --hud-amber: #f59e0b;\\n    --hud-crimson: #ef4444;\\n  }\\n\\n  body {\\n    background-color: #020611;\\n    color: #e0f2fe;\\n    font-family: \'Rajdhani\', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, sans-serif;\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n.font-orbitron {\\n  font-family: \'Orbitron\', monospace, sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\n.font-rajdhani {\\n  font-family: \'Rajdhani\', sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\n.font-mono-code {\\n  font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace;\\n}\\n\\n/* Sci-fi HUD glow effects */\\n.glow-cyan {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35), inset 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-cyan-lg {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.5), inset 0 0 25px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-amber {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4), inset 0 0 15px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-crimson {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.6), inset 0 0 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-text-cyan {\\n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.7), 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-text-amber {\\n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.7);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-text-crimson {\\n  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.8);\\n}\\n\\n/* Futuristic Scanline Effect */\\n.scanlines {\\n  background: linear-gradient(\\n    to bottom,\\n    rgba(255,255,255,0),\\n    rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%,\\n    rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.02) 50%,\\n    rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.02)\\n  );\\n  background-size: 100% 4px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Tech grid background */\\n.bg-tech-grid {\\n  background-size: 32px 32px;\\n  background-image: \\n    linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),\\n    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);\\n}\\n\\n/* Angular sci-fi clip-paths */\\n.clip-hud-corner {\\n  clip-path: polygon(\\n    0 0,\\n    calc(100% - 14px) 0,\\n    100% 14px,\\n    100% 100%,\\n    14px 100%,\\n    0 calc(100% - 14px)\\n  );\\n}\\n\\n.clip-hud-tab {\\n  clip-path: polygon(\\n    12px 0,\\n    calc(100% - 12px) 0,\\n    100% 100%,\\n    0 100%\\n  );\\n}\\n\\n/* Animations */\\n@keyframes spinSlow {\\n  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }\\n  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes spinReverse {\\n  from { transform: rotate(360deg); }\\n  to { transform: rotate(0deg); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes pulseGlow {\\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.85; transform: scale(1); }\\n  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.03); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes radarSweep {\\n  0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\\n  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\\n}\\n\\n.animate-spin-slow {\\n  animation: spinSlow 20s linear infinite;\\n}\\n\\n.animate-spin-reverse {\\n  animation: spinReverse 14s linear infinite;\\n}\\n\\n.animate-pulse-glow {\\n  animation: pulseGlow 3s ease-in-out infinite;\\n}\\n\\n.animate-radar {\\n  animation: radarSweep 4s linear infinite;\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom scrollbars */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 5px;\\n  height: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.85);\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);\\n  border-radius: 2px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6);\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Add Stark HUD styling, sci-fi animations, glowing utilities, and custom fonts\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing src/index.css\",\"toolSummary\":\"Write HUD CSS styles\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 14
      nanos: 832672053
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    provider_assigned_message_id: "J0rSarnhJczQz7IP74fh4Q8"
  }
