  planner_response {
    response: "The **JARVIS Hands-Free Mobile Simulator & Scenario Studio** is now available in your app, complete with a scenario customizer so you can make and test changes directly:\n\n### \360\237\223\261 1. Interactive Hands-Free Phone Simulation\n* **Exact Mobile Flow**: Modeled after the hands-free interface (`9:00  5G  \342\226\256\342\226\256\342\226\256`, `# Jarvis - Hands-free`, dynamic visualizer, and states: *Idle \342\206\222 Listening \342\206\222 Deciding \342\206\222 Confirming \342\206\222 Acting \342\206\222 Done*).\n* **\"What talking to it feels like\"**: Watch the automated scripted walkthrough or step through it manually with voice synthesis (`speechSynthesis` and Gemini TTS) and audio sound effects.\n* **Interactive Confirmation Card**: When Jarvis asks for confirmation (*\"Should I send this SMS to Happy Hogan?\"*, *\"Ready to call Pepper on speakerphone?\"*), tap **Confirm** or **Cancel** directly inside the phone interface.\n* **Simulated Device Notifications**: Watch native-style notification banners slide down for SMS, phone calls, smart home climate changes, Spotify music playback, calendar events, and food deliveries.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 2. \"Make Changes for Me\" \342\200\224 Scenario Studio & Creator\n* **Edit Existing Scenarios**: Click **Edit** on any scenario card (Text Happy Hogan, Call Pepper Potts, Workshop Thermostat, Play AC/DC, Flight Test Calendar, Order Shawarma) to modify:\n  * **User Voice Input**: Change what you say to Jarvis.\n  * **Agent Reasoning & Decision**: Adjust the agent\'s internal thought process and tool selection.\n  * **Confirmation Prompt**: Customize the confirmation question or toggle instant execution without confirmation.\n  * **Device Action & Notification**: Customize the success message, app name, and notification text.\n* **Create New Scenarios**: Tap **\"+ Create Scenario\"** to build your own custom voice workflows from scratch.\n* **Instant Live Testing**: Click **\"Save & Test Run\"** to immediately watch your customized scenario play out in the phone simulator.\n* **Persistent Storage**: All custom edits and new scenarios are saved to your browser so they remain intact across sessions, with a one-click **\"Defaults\"** button to restore original templates.\n\nYou can switch between the **\360\237\223\261 Hands-Free Simulator & Studio** and the **\342\232\241 Tactical Command HUD** (with the 3D Arc Reactor, Stark Armory, and Power Matrix) using the top navigation bar."
