  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining HudHeaderProps**\n\nI\'m currently focused on expanding `HudHeaderProps`. I plan to introduce `voicePersona`, which will be either \'EDITH\' or \'JARVIS\', and an `onVoicePersonaChange` function. This should allow toggling the voice persona in the `HudHeader` component itself. I need to make sure the implementation handles display of the voice persona badge or toggle.\n\n\n**Implementing Voice Persona Switch**\n\nI\'ve got the voice persona toggle button working in the `HudHeader` now. Clicking the button cycles between \'EDITH\' and \'JARVIS\'. I\'ve incorporated the visual styling for the voice persona badge, including the gradient and colors. I also made sure to include \"Peter\" in the titles list. I\'m also adding an E.D.I.T.H. scenario to `HandsFreeStudio.tsx`!\n\n\n**Deploying Orbital Drone Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating the orbital drone deployment functionality, triggering via a simulated E.D.I.T.H. command. I\'m adding a \"Test E.D.I.T.H. Voice\" button to `HandsFreeStudio.tsx` to streamline testing. I am also working on connecting the voice command to the backend to get the expected E.D.I.T.H. response and feedback loop into the AR HUD.\n\n\n"
