    thinking: "**Adding E.D.I.T.H. Test**\n\nI\'m now integrating an \"E.D.I.T.H. Voice Test\" button into the HandsFreeStudio. This will reside either on the phone frame or the top bar, allowing for direct triggering of a voice test. Pressing the button will initiate `speech.speakText(\"Hello, Peter. I am E.D.I.T.H.,\")` so the user can easily test the voice response.\n\n\n**Implementing E.D.I.T.H. Scenario**\n\nI\'ve just added the \"E.D.I.T.H. Drone Target Lock\" scenario, inspired by Spider-Man: Far From Home, as a default option. It\'s under \"Stark Defense.\" The scenario includes the voice command, agent response, tool invocation (deploying orbital drones), and a confirmation prompt. The tool deploys orbital drones with a non-lethal EMP. It\'s pretty cool; even dead, I\'m the hero, right?\n\n\n"
