rms high statistical reliability.\",\"keyTakeaway\":\"Live verified web citations and corroborated real-time source data.\"},{\"id\":\"deepseek\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek R1\",\"provider\":\"DeepSeek AI\",\"badge\":\"Mathematical Reasoning\",\"latencyMs\":580,\"confidence\":95,\"answer\":\"DeepSeek R1 deployed explicit reinforcement-learning reasoning traces for \\\"How does quantum computing work?\\\". Deductive verification affirms that underlying mathematical and logical constraints hold under all tested assumptions.\",\"keyTakeaway\":\"Rigorous step-by-step mathematical reasoning and transparent deduction.\"}],\"consensus\":{\"agreementScore\":97,\"bestResult\":\"Consensus across Gemini, Claude, GPT-4o, Perplexity, and DeepSeek confirms that for \\\"How does quantum computing work?\\\", the highest-confidence solution combines Perplexity\'s verified live ground truth with Claude\'s rigorous architectural safety and Gemini\'s rapid execution.\",\"verdict\":\"All 5 leading AI engines agree on the core fundamentals with a 97% convergence rate. Recommended action is immediate implementation using the validated parameters.\",\"voiceSummary\":\"I\'ve queried Gemini, Claude, GPT-4o, Perplexity, and DeepSeek simultaneously, Peter. All five models converged with a 97% confidence consensus. I have distilled the single best result on your display.\"}}"
