I\'m also preparing a \\\"Diagnostics & Code Terminal\\\" for live telemetry.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View metadata.json\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":13,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T15:59:40Z\",\"input_tokens\":3780,\"cache_read_tokens\":40819,\"output_tokens\":48,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/index.html\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing index.html\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View index.html\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":15,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T15:59:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":2605,\"cache_read_tokens\":42469,\"output_tokens\":331,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing File Content**\\n\\nOkay, I\'ve started examining `metadata.json` and `index.html`. My immediate focus is on `metadata.json`, where I\'m updating the information. The \\\"name\\\" is now set to \\\"JARVIS,\\\" the \\\"description\\\" now explains its capabilities, and I\'ve also added \\\"microphone\\\" to the list of \\\"requestFramePermissions\\\".\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Set app name to JARVIS and configure description and permissions\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"6\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update name to JARVIS, add description and microphone permission\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"JARVIS\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Just A Rather Very Intelligent System - Futuristic holographic AI interface with tactical telemetry, voice synthesis, arc reactor power matrix, and Stark protocols.\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"requestFramePermissions\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"mic\\n<truncated 87 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"