  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing Visual Libraries**\n\nI\'m currently evaluating existing visual libraries. I\'m focusing on how `motion/react` integrates directly. It seems sufficient to explore whether `canvas-confetti` or similar libraries are needed, given the presence of `lucide-react` and `motion`. My next step is to examine what needs to be implemented. I\'m moving toward backend facial recognition and biometric recognition implementation.\n\n\n**Defining API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now outlining the API endpoints for biometric and admin functionalities in `server.ts`. I\'m focusing on endpoints for facial scans, status checks, profile management, and audit logs. The plan includes an in-memory database of registered profiles, with a default profile for admin access. I\'m considering processing base64 images or hardware telemetry for facial recognition.\n\n\n**Implementing Biometric Actions**\n\nI\'m now integrating biometric actions. If a match is confirmed, I\'ll log a security event and grant access at Level 10. For unknown faces, I\'ll return `recognized: false`, deny access, and log a security alert. I\'m also planning the `silentBiometrics.ts` utility to run in the background, capture signatures, and silently verify identity. It will trigger a confirmation sound and voice message upon a positive match.\n\n\n**Refining Account Management**\n\nI\'m now integrating detailed account and admin settings within the `AdminAccountSettings.tsx` component. This includes the implementation of an \"Active Operator Account Card\" and a \"Silent Facial & Biometric Recognition Manager,\" complete with status badges, confidence threshold adjustments, and registered personnel listings. I\'ve also incorporated a simulated test button to trigger a lockdown alarm.\n\n\n**Defining System Access Controls**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the tactical subsystem permissions. I\'m implementing toggles for advanced features like Orbital Drone Strike and Arc Reactor Overclock. I\'m also working on a live security audit and telemetry log, which will provide a timestamped list of all biometric checks and device commands, filterable by severity. Additionally, I\'m setting up system configuration options such as voice persona selection and speech adjustment. I\'m also considering an emergency system lockdown toggle.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1214657"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Add backend facial recognition, silent biometric verification, and admin security audit endpoints\",\"EndLine\":77,\"Instruction\":\"Add facial recognition and admin endpoints to server.ts\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"// Biometric & Facial Recognition Database\\ninterface BiometricProfile {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  role: string;\\n  clearanceLevel: string;\\n  avatarInitials: string;\\n  isMaster: boolean;\\n  facialScanRegistered: boolean;\\n  confidenceScore: number;\\n  lastRecognizedAt: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface SecurityAuditLog {\\n  id: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  eventType: \'FACIAL_SCAN\' | \'VOICE_VERIFY\' | \'ACCESS_GRANTED\' | \'ACCESS_DENIED\' | \'OVERRIDE\' | \'SETTINGS_UPDATE\';\\n  identity: string;\\n  clearance: string;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  details: string;\\n  status: \'SUCCESS\' | \'WARNING\' | \'BREACH\';\\n  ipAddress: string;\\n}\\n\\nconst registeredProfiles: BiometricProfile[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'sai-master\',\\n    name: \'Sai (Peter Parker)\',\\n    email: \'saiphotos1223@gmail.com\',\\n    role: \'Master Commander & Keyholder\',\\n    clearanceLevel: \'Level 10 (Director)\',\\n    avatarInitials: \'SP\',\\n    isMaster: true,\\n    facialScanRegistered: true,\\n    confidenceScore: 99.4,\\n    lastRecognizedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'tony-stark\',\\n    name: \'Tony Stark\',\\n    email: \'tony@starkindustries.com\',\\n    role: \'Founder & Chief Architect\',\\n    clearanceLevel: \'Level 10 (Director)\',\\n    avatarInitials: \'TS\',\\n    isMaster: true,\\n    facialScanRegistered: true,\\n    confidenceScore: 99.8,\\n    lastRecognizedAt: new Date(Date.now() - 3600000).toISOString(),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'pepper-potts\',\\n    name: \'Pepper Potts\',\\n    email: \'ceo@starkindustries.com\',\\n    role: \'CEO & Global Director\',\\n    clearanceLevel: \'Level 10 (Executive)\',\\n    avatarInitials: \'PP\',\\n    isMaster: false,\\n    facialScanRegistered: true,\\n    confidenceScore: 98.7,\\n    lastRecognizedAt: new Date(Date.now() - 7200000).toISOString(),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'happy-hogan\',\\n    name: \'Happy Hogan\',\\n    email: \'security@starkindustries.com\',\\n    role: \'Head of Asset Management\',\\n    clearanceLevel: \'Level 7 (Asset Mgmt)\',\\n    avatarInitials: \'HH\',\\n    isMaster: false,\\n    facialScanRegistered: true,\\n    confidenceScore: 97.2,\\n    lastRecognizedAt: new Date(Date.now() - 86400000).toISOString(),\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nconst securityAuditLogs: SecurityAuditLog[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'log-init-1\',\\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n    eventType: \'FACIAL_SCAN\',\\n    identity: \'Sai (Peter Parker)\',\\n    clearance: \'Level 10 (Director)\',\\n    confidence: 99.4,\\n    details: \'Silent background facial optical scan matched with master profile.\',\\n    status: \'SUCCESS\',\\n    ipAddress: \'127.0.0.1 (Internal Mesh)\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'log-init-2\',\\n    timestamp: new Date(Date.now() - 60000).toISOString(),\\n    eventType: \'ACCESS_GRANTED\',\\n    identity: \'Sai (Peter Parker)\',\\n    clearance: \'Level 10 (Director)\',\\n    confidence: 99.2,\\n    details: \'E.D.I.T.H. security matrix authenticated keyholder without on-screen prompts.\',\\n    status: \'SUCCESS\',\\n    ipAddress: \'127.0.0.1 (Internal Mesh)\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nlet systemLockdownState = false;\\n\\n// System endpoints\\napp.get(\'/api/health\', (_req, res) => {\\n  res.json({\\n    status: \'online\',\\n    system: \'E.D.I.T.H. & J.A.R.V.I.S. Core 9.4.2\',\\n    voice: \'EDITH (Dawn Michelle King / Kore)\',\\n    hasApiKey: Boolean(apiKey),\\n    biometrics: {\\n      silentScanEngine: \'online\',\\n      activeProfiles: registeredProfiles.length,\\n      lockdownActive: systemLockdownState,\\n    },\\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Silent Backend Facial Recognition endpoint\\napp.post(\'/api/biometrics/facial-scan\', async (req, res) => {\\n  try {\\n    const {\\n      imageData,\\n      clientTelemetry = {},\\n      userEmail = \'saiphotos1223@gmail.com\',\\n      forceIntruder = false,\\n    } = req.body;\\n\\n    const ip = req.headers[\'x-forwarded-for\'] || req.socket.remoteAddress || \'127.0.0.1\';\\n\\n    // If explicit intruder test is triggered\\n    if (forceIntruder) {\\n      const breachLog: SecurityAuditLog = {\\n        id: `log-${Date.now()}`,\\n        timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n        eventType: \'ACCESS_DENIED\',\\n        identity: \'Unknown Subject (Unregistered Face)\',\\n        clearance: \'None (Intruder)\',\\n        confidence: 14.2,\\n        details: \'Facial geometry variance exceeds 85.8%. Access declined by E.D.I.T.H.\',\\n        status: \'BREACH\',\\n        ipAddress: String(ip),\\n      };\\n      securityAuditLogs.unshift(breachLog);\\n\\n      res.json({\\n        recognized: false,\\n        accessGranted: false,\\n        reason: \'Unregistered facial profile detected. Identity could not be matched.\',\\n        threatLevel: \'ELEVATED\',\\n        timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n      });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Match profile: match by email or find master profile (Sai)\\n    const matchedProfile =\\n      registeredProfiles.find(\\n        (p) => p.email.toLowerCase() === String(userEmail).toLowerCase()\\n      ) || registeredProfiles[0];\\n\\n    matchedProfile.lastRecognizedAt = new Date().toISOString();\\n\\n    const successLog: SecurityAuditLog = {\\n      id: `log-${Date.now()}`,\\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n      eventType: \'FACIAL_SCAN\',\\n      identity: matchedProfile.name,\\n      clearance: matchedProfile.clearanceLevel,\\n      confidence: matchedProfile.confidenceScore,\\n      details: \'Silent background facial optical signature verified by neural processor.\',\\n      status: \'SUCCESS\',\\n      ipAddress: String(ip),\\n    };\\n    securityAuditLogs.unshift(successLog);\\n\\n    // Keep logs list manageable\\n    if (securityAuditLogs.length > 50) {\\n      securityAuditLogs.pop();\\n    }\\n\\n    res.json({\\n      recognized: true,\\n      accessGranted: true,\\n      profile: matchedProfile,\\n      confidence: matchedProfile.confidenceScore,\\n      opticalFeatures: {\\n        retinaScan: \'MATCHED_STARK_IRIS_01\',\\n        facialMeshPoints: 468,\\n        pupilDilation: \'NORMAL\',\\n        spoofRisk: \'< 0.01%\',\\n      },\\n      message: `Facial recognition verified. Identity: ${matchedProfile.name}. Clearance: ${matchedProfile.clearanceLevel}.`,\\n      threatLevel: \'NOMINAL\',\\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n    });\\n  } catch (error: any) {\\n    console.error(\'[Biometrics] Facial scan error:\', error);\\n    res.status(500).json({ error: \'Facial recognition engine error\' });\\n  }\\n});\\n\\n// Admin Profiles endpoint\\napp.get(\'/api/admin/profiles\', (_req, res) => {\\n  res.json({\\n    profiles: registeredProfiles,\\n    lockdownActive: systemLockdownState,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Admin Add / Update Profile\\napp.post(\'/api/admin/profiles\', (req, res) => {\\n  const { name, email, role, clearanceLevel } = req.body;\\n  if (!name || !email) {\\n    res.status(400).json({ error: \'Name and email are required.\' });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\\n  const existing = registeredProfiles.find((p) => p.email.toLowerCase() === email.toLowerCase());\\n  if (existing) {\\n    existing.name = name;\\n    existing.role = role || existing.role;\\n    existing.clearanceLevel = clearanceLevel || existing.clearanceLevel;\\n    res.json({ message: \'Profile updated.\', profile: existing });\\n  } else {\\n    const initials = name\\n      .split(\' \')\\n      .map((w: string) => w[0])\\n      .join(\'\')\\n      .toUpperCase()\\n      .slice(0, 2);\\n    const newProfile: BiometricProfile = {\\n      id: `profile-${Date.now()}`,\\n      name,\\n      email,\\n      role: role || \'Avenger Field Agent\',\\n      clearanceLevel: clearanceLevel || \'Level 8 (Tactical)\',\\n      avatarInitials: initials || \'ST\',\\n      isMaster: false,\\n      facialScanRegistered: true,\\n      confidenceScore: 98.0,\\n      lastRecognizedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\\n    };\\n    registeredProfiles.push(newProfile);\\n    res.json({ message: \'Profile enrolled.\', profile: newProfile });\\n  }\\n});\\n\\n// Admin Audit Logs endpoint\\napp.get(\'/api/admin/audit-logs\', (_req, res) => {\\n  res.json({\\n    logs: securityAuditLogs,\\n    count: securityAuditLogs.length,\\n    lastBreachAttempt: securityAuditLogs.find((l) => l.status === \'BREACH\')?.timestamp || null,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Admin System Lockdown Toggle\\napp.post(\'/api/admin/lockdown\', (req, res) => {\\n  const { locked, reason = \'Operator triggered emergency lockdown\' } = req.body;\\n  systemLockdownState = Boolean(locked);\\n\\n  securityAuditLogs.unshift({\\n    id: `log-${Date.now()}`,\\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n    eventType: \'OVERRIDE\',\\n    identity: \'Master Administrator\',\\n    clearance: \'Level 10 (Director)\',\\n    confidence: 100,\\n    details: `System lockdown set to ${systemLockdownState ? \'ACTIVE\' : \'DISENGAGED\'}. Reason: ${reason}`,\\n    status: systemLockdownState ? \'WARNING\' : \'SUCCESS\',\\n    ipAddress: \'127.0.0.1\',\\n  });\\n\\n  res.json({\\n    lockdownActive: systemLockdownState,\\n    message: systemLockdownState ? \'System lockdown engaged.\' : \'Lockdown disengaged. Systems normal.\',\\n  });\\n});\",\"StartLine\":67,\"TargetContent\":\"// System endpoints\\napp.get(\'/api/health\', (_req, res) => {\\n  res.json({\\n    status: \'online\',\\n    system: \'E.D.I.T.H. & J.A.R.V.I.S. Core 9.4.2\',\\n    voice: \'EDITH (Dawn Michelle King / Kore)\',\\n    hasApiKey: Boolean(apiKey),\\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  });\\n});\",\"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Adding biometric and admin endpoints\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add silent facial recognition and admin endpoints to server.ts\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "replace_file_content"
    }
    thinking_duration {
