    thinking: "**Analyzing App Code**\n\nI\'m currently looking into `src/App.tsx` and considering the implementation of silent background facial recognition. The user wants the app to remember facial and biometric recognition data without requiring prompts. I\'m focusing on how to integrate this functionality safely and efficiently within the existing structure.\n\n\n**Implementing Silent Authentication**\n\nI\'ve made progress on silent facial recognition. On app mount, `silentBiometrics.performSilentScan()` now executes, bypassing on-screen permission prompts. This allows for immediate user recognition and unlocking, unless unauthorized access is detected, triggering the lock state. I\'m focusing on ensuring this process is seamless and secure, with admin controls to simulate unauthorized access for testing.\n\n\n**Designing UI Animations**\n\nI\'m focused on cool transitions and animations using `motion/react`, especially the futuristic slide-fade with a holographic scanline. I\'m prioritizing responsive design, targeting touch targets and font sizing for all devices, including a bottom dock navigation bar for mobile. Ensuring a smooth scrollbar and avoiding horizontal clipping is also key. I\'ll review code for `src/App.tsx` next.\n\n\n"
