    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":254,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T16:35:04Z\",\"input_tokens\":2641,\"cache_read_tokens\":30394,\"output_tokens\":703,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing User Requests**\\n\\nI\'ve just compacted the conversation history to focus on the latest state and the user\'s explicit requests. Right now, I\'m carefully analyzing the single, concise request from the user: to change the voice to \\\"Edith\\\" in the Spider-Man look, and also search for it online.\\n\\n\\n**Defining Task Scope**\\n\\nI\'m now clarifying the scope of this request, which expanded significantly. It\'s no longer just a voice change, but a comprehensive, voice-controlled assistant with broad phone access, simultaneous AI searches, and human-like interaction. Security is paramount, requiring voice authentication. The focus-mode directive indicates a specific interaction or task, and I\'m processing the implications of the backend integration and mobile installation details the user needs.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/focus_mode/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing focus-mode skill\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View focus-mode skill\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":256,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T16:35:12Z\",\"input_tokens\":3085,\"cache_read_tokens\":31790,\"output_tokens\":105,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/pwa_integration/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing pwa-integration skill\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View pwa-integration skill\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":258,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T16:35:14Z\",\"input_tokens\":8731,\"cache_read_tokens\":34863,\"output_tokens\":213,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the CSS Selector**\\n\\nI am now dissecting this specific CSS selector, breaking down each component to understand its precision and potential impact on the DOM. My focus is on identifying any redundancies or potential for optimization within this deeply nested structure. I am paying close attention to the use of nth-of-type and considering alternatives.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/HudHeader.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing HudHeader.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View HudHeader.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":260,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T16:35:22Z\",\"input_tokens\":3945,\"cache_read_tokens\":41596,\"output_tokens\":1163,\"thinking\":\"**Tracing the Selector\'s Path**\\n\\nI\'m currently dissecting this long selector. I\'ve begun tracing its steps to understand how it targets a specific element. I\'m focusing on each segment, starting from `div#root`, and working my way down the DOM tree. I am on line 6.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing the Component Hierarchy**\\n\\nI\'ve moved on to examining the nested structure within the `div.flex.items-center.gap-2` element. I\'m paying close attention to the `span:nth-of-type(1)` element and its role, considering the conditional r\\n<truncated 7 bytes>\\ng based on the `voicePersona`. The HTML structure suggests how the branding and system ID are displayed within the header, allowing me to understand the components\' presentation.\\n\\n\\n**Pinpointing the Target Element**\\n\\nI\'ve zeroed in on the specific `span` element within the `div.flex.items-center.gap-2` structure.  I\'ve confirmed it\'s the target, analyzing its attributes, particularly the conditional text rendering based on `voicePersona`. The selected element is a badge and the user intends to remove it.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/HudHeader.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"95\",\"StartLine\":\"70\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing header badge lines\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View header badge in HudHeader.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":262,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T16:35:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":3990,\"cache_read_tokens\":43697,\"output_tokens\":305,\"thinking\":\"**Reviewing User Requests**\\n\\nI\'m now reviewing the user\'s past requests to ensure all tasks are progressing as expected. I\'m focusing on the voice change and file integration to make sure everything requested is functioning seamlessly. I\'m cross-referencing this current task with the previous requests, in particular the voice modification.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing src files\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List files in src directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":264,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T16:35:38Z\",\"input_tokens\":2499,\"cache_read_tokens\":45677,\"output_tokens\":51,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src/components\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing components directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List components directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":266,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T16:35:41Z\",\"input_tokens\":2330,\"cache_read_tokens\":46099,\"output_tokens\":163,\"thinking\":\"**Checking App Integration**\\n\\nI\'ve already created `VoiceBiometricGate.tsx`, `PhoneAccessHub.tsx`, `MultiAiSearchModule.tsx`, `HandsFreeStudio.tsx`, and `PWAInstallButton.tsx`. Now, I\'m analyzing `src/App.tsx` to understand its core functionalities and ensure smooth integration, especially after removing that element in `HudHead