  planner_response {
    response: "### How to Install the App on Your Mobile Phone\n\nThe assistant is built as a **Progressive Web App (PWA)**, meaning you can install it directly onto your mobile phone without needing the Google Play Store or Apple App Store. Once installed, it behaves like a native mobile app: full-screen with no browser address bar, instant launch from your home screen, and offline service worker caching.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Open the App on Your Phone\nYou have two quick ways to open it on your mobile device:\n\n1. **Option A (Instant QR Scan)**:\n   * Look at the top-right header in this app and click **\"INSTALL ON MOBILE\"**.\n   * An interactive QR code will appear on your screen. Point your phone\342\200\231s camera at the QR code and tap the notification link to open the app.\n2. **Option B (Direct Link)**:\n   * Copy the app URL and paste it into your phone\'s browser:\n     * **Android**: Open in **Google Chrome**, **Microsoft Edge**, or **Samsung Internet**.\n     * **iPhone / iPad**: Open in **Apple Safari**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Install to Home Screen\n\n#### For Android (Google Chrome / Samsung Internet)\n1. Open the URL in **Google Chrome**.\n2. Tap the glowing **\"INSTALL NOW\"** banner if prompted, **OR**:\n3. Tap the **three vertical dots (`\342\213\256`)** in the top-right corner of the browser.\n4. Tap **\"Install app\"** (or **\"Add to Home screen\"**).\n5. Tap **\"Install\"** to confirm.\n6. The **E.D.I.T.H. / J.A.R.V.I.S.** icon will be added to your home screen and app launcher.\n\n---\n\n#### For iPhone & iPad (Apple Safari)\n1. Open the URL in **Apple Safari** (*note: Apple only supports PWA installation through Safari*).\n2. Tap the **Share icon** at the bottom of the screen (the square with an arrow pointing upward: `\342\216\213`).\n3. Scroll down the share sheet and tap **\"Add to Home Screen\"** (marked with a `[+]` icon).\n4. Tap **\"Add\"** in the top-right corner.\n5. The tactical icon will immediately appear on your iPhone home screen.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Launching & Mobile Permissions\n\nWhen you open the app from your home screen:\n1. **Full-Screen Tactical UI**: It will open without browser tabs, bookmarks, or search bars.\n2. **Voice Permission**: When prompted, tap **\"Allow\"** for microphone access. This enables hands-free voice commands and biometric voiceprint matching.\n3. **Background Facial Recognition**: The app runs optical and neural biometric checks in the background without intrusive camera viewfinders or permission popups.\n4. **Mobile Bottom Dock**: On mobile screens, a dedicated thumb-friendly bottom dock provides one-tap switching between **Omni-AI Search**, **Phone Subsystem Controls**, **Voice Command Center**, **Admin & Security**, and **Protocols**."
    modified_response: "### How to Install the App on Your Mobile Phone\n\nThe assistant is built as a **Progressive Web App (PWA)**, meaning you can install it directly onto your mobile phone without needing the Google Play Store or Apple App Store. Once installed, it behaves like a native mobile app: full-screen with no browser address bar, instant launch from your home screen, and offline service worker caching.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Open the App on Your Phone\nYou have two quick ways to open it on your mobile device:\n\n1. **Option A (Instant QR Scan)**:\n   * Look at the top-right header in this app and click **\"INSTALL ON MOBILE\"**.\n   * An interactive QR code will appear on your screen. Point your phone\342\200\231s camera at the QR code and tap the notification link to open the app.\n2. **Option B (Direct Link)**:\n   * Copy the app URL and paste it into your phone\'s browser:\n     * **Android**: Open in **Google Chrome**, **Microsoft Edge**, or **Samsung Internet**.\n     * **iPhone / iPad**: Open in **Apple Safari**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Install to Home Screen\n\n#### For Android (Google Chrome / Samsung Internet)\n1. Open the URL in **Google Chrome**.\n2. Tap the glowing **\"INSTALL NOW\"** banner if prompted, **OR**:\n3. Tap the **three vertical dots (`\342\213\256`)** in the top-right corner of the browser.\n4. Tap **\"Install app\"** (or **\"Add to Home screen\"**).\n5. Tap **\"Install\"** to confirm.\n6. The **E.D.I.T.H. / J.A.R.V.I.S.** icon will be added to your home screen and app launcher.\n\n---\n\n#### For iPhone & iPad (Apple Safari)\n1. Open the URL in **Apple Safari** (*note: Apple only supports PWA installation through Safari*).\n2. Tap the **Share icon** at the bottom of the screen (the square with an arrow pointing upward: `\342\216\213`).\n3. Scroll down the share sheet and tap **\"Add to Home Screen\"** (marked with a `[+]` icon).\n4. Tap **\"Add\"** in the top-right corner.\n5. The tactical icon will immediately appear on your iPhone home screen.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Launching & Mobile Permissions\n\nWhen you open the app from your home screen:\n1. **Full-Screen Tactical UI**: It will open without browser tabs, bookmarks, or search bars.\n2. **Voice Permission**: When prompted, tap **\"Allow\"** for microphone access. This enables hands-free voice commands and biometric voiceprint matching.\n3. **Background Facial Recognition**: The app runs optical and neural biometric checks in the background without intrusive camera viewfinders or permission popups.\n4. **Mobile Bottom Dock**: On mobile screens, a dedicated thumb-friendly bottom dock provides one-tap switching between **Omni-AI Search**, **Phone Subsystem Controls**, **Voice Command Center**, **Admin & Security**, and **Protocols**."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\340\002\n\335\002\001i\024}\023\236_\231A\255\224Pf\315\201\b5\257\020\223W\260\221\233\2310(\034\325\300$\225\024q~\245\273V\340)q\033\321U\255\030\212\212xG\270;fJ{F\260\255q\320\353\221\306a\273\265|\220\276\205\364\364\034\212\276\002\224SC\360\030\2315\235\005;\f\000\365\242\2500P-S\261\276\301\216/\222\345\205\2248\202\261\253J\352n\313\003\366\377\267\037:\362@\275\233\001\235\3738\336\341N-\204 0&\247\276\334\003G$\324\246\035\201p\274e9\321\306\247\377\261\321n\332V\213\r\232f\235\346-Q\312\314F\244\3325\t\001\203\023\250\261mol\215\202A\241\345/\302.#\343qv\3652\355\262$p\360u<\f\316\372\367#\314Q8\r\322\030\371\210\267\312G@~\244\257(\261\335\2633\316E\307\260\363,\030\f\017q\0028\325\226\004\356E\317\353alV\210\035U\260l\020d\035\324w\3068\256\244Q\265\302\361P\223\264\001\306\232\260A\305\241`PX\021\273%Ynrt\352\034\241\247d5\261\017\016\222\200}3R\025i\200\312IPtq\232n\327\300\307\033\362e\034\221\302l\025\217\"\350\214\375\035sMWA\275[\211\366\"\311\360J\002\022\\\264F\330%\017g\257"
